  config.evens[0]: 3 fails where it % 2 == 0
  set by layer dev
  expected by a/a.canon:21 (evens: [Even])

error[E3206]  a/dev.canon:6:12
  config.by[a]: 5 fails where it % 2 == 0
  set by layer dev
  expected by a/a.canon:23 (by: {String: Even})

error[E3206]  a/dev.canon:10:6
  items[a]: Item{name: "a", n: -1} fails where it.n >= 0
  set by layer dev
  expected by a/a.canon:30 (items: [Pos] keyed by name)

